 :59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Camera-ready: 1 Jun 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\
 n  Early registration: 1 Jun 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nThe call for
  papers states no timezone. This is counted as UTC+12\, the earliest it co
 uld plausibly mean\, so the countdown runs out before the real deadline ra
 ther than after it.\n\n5th edition of the conference. Papers are limited t
 o 6 pages. The call for papers flyer gives 1 June 2027 for camera-ready an
 d early registration\, while the conference website lists final paper subm
 ission and author registration on 1 July 2027\; the earlier date is shown 
